  "prefLabel": "Eth 104.03 Custodian of Records",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Eth 104.03 Custodian of Records. The records of the committee shall be maintained at the department of justice, which shall respond to requests to examine those portions of the committee’s records which are governmental records, per RSA 91-A:4.\n\nSource. #12617-A, eff 9-6-18",
